  - Id: intro_blaine
    Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9df529c97f3e3d84390ec14e27c41bbf, type: 2}
    DialogueText: "David Blaine was my 3rd ever student. Second was a fella named
      Jesus. Now he didn't learn too much \u2014 I didn't know Spanish and he wasn't
      great with English, but he was a good trier."
    Choices:
    - ChoiceText: Uh, what?
      NextNodeId: offer_open
      QuestGate: 0
      QuestGateId: 
